==Trivia==
* Yveltal played a similar role to the [[Meta Groudon]] from ''[[M06|Jirachi: Wish Maker]]'', also released on July 19. Both are the generation's red [[game mascot]]s, started a rampage in which they absorbed life energy from plants, people and Pokémon, including {{TRT}} and the film's antagonist or antagonists, and were stopped by another of the featured Pokémon in the movie (Xerneas or {{OBP|Jirachi|M06}}), who revived everyone and everything they absorbed energy from before going to sleep.

